WEBVTT

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:05.150
NASA...

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:08.570
Similar to the Space Development Corporation...

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.610
...it is the pinnacle of space technology research...

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.820
...staffed by the best and brightest of mankind.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.870
Currently, a joint experiment with the U. S...

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.910
...is being conducted here at the New Nevada Research Center.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.420
Observation Deck, ready to go! Okay!

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.590
Solitary Wave Risers, 1st to <i>13th...</i>

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:35.510
Prepare to fire!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.350
Every platform, execute test-fire.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.060
Acoustic Field Oscillator, pre-feedback activated!

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.610
All GS-Rides operating smoothly, sir!

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.700
Confirm generation of space static energy.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.070
Energy soliton confirmed!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.780
Solitary Wave Risers, fire!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.350
Every platform operating 90% accurately...

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.100
...according to the simulation data.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.730
Great work, Mr. Liger!

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.730
Now, then, time for data collection!

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.320
I can't wait to see Japan again!

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:37.700
Leo... and also Gai!

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:41.190
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:44.090
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.920
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:55.090
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:01.810
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:06.090
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:11.010
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.930
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.730
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:21.490
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.490
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:29.660
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:32.200
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.330
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.290
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:42.370
Dividing Driver!

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:50.010
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:55.890
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.840
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:02.730
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.740
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.700
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:10.160
Mic 13

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.000
<i>Mic 13</i>

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.140
All right! All right! Punch! Punch!

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.930
Swivel around and punch again!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:29.100
...some showers during the day, but sunshine will follow soon after!

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:32.480
That's what she's been saying everyday...

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.980
...but it's been a week since we've seen the sun!

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.650
Mamoru, isn't it time for you to go?

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:39.860
Yeah!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.610
Okay, I'll see you later then!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.570
Be back in time for dinner, all right?

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.990
Okay!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.710
All this rain...

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.170
It's perfect Zonder weather!

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.260
They better not show up today...

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.800
Whoops! I'm late, I'm late!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.560
GGG's Amphibious Armored Maintenance Vehicle is approaching...

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:13.310
...its rendezvous point with a U.S. submarine, the Orlando.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:18.150
The purpose of this operation is to receive the U.S. - made A.I. Robot...

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.990
...being provided in exchange for Japan's GS-Ride technology.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.870
Orlando now approaching. We're ready to start the docking process.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:29.080
They're going to a lot of trouble with all this secrecy.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.000
Just how big a deal can the CR System be?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:35.540
From what I've heard, it's cause for far more secrecy than the Pliers.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.840
Apparently, they're using the GS-Ride in a very unique way.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.730
Docking with Orlando complete.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.070
Water pressure check, complete.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.610
Now releasing the safety lock.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.860
Gai, you'd better duck, my boy!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:06.780
But why?

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.410
Yahoo!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:24.590
Hello!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.090
It's been a long time, Uncle Liger!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.390
Gai! How about those Pliers I sent you? They coming in handy?

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.270
Yes, they've been a big help.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.230
Didn't I tell you? Didn't I tell you?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.310
What do you mean, "Didn't I tell you"?

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.440
The Leo Lariat...

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.280
With a power boost from his jet-skates, its velocity is devastating.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:49.030
What's the big idea?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.160
Who are you to talk in that get-up, Big Brother?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.330
Why don't you act your age?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:55.500
Why, you...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.460
I'm not taking that from YOU, of all people!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:05:59.960
The Liger Uppercut...

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.460
...thanks to a power boost from his jet-powered glove...

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.670
...its velocity is enough to make the gods tremble.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.340
Now I'm livid!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.010
You wanna fight?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.430
You old geezer!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:13.220
Who's the geezer? Speak for yourself, Pruneface!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.520
Oh, boy, always fighting when they get together, these two!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.330
So is that your newest mecha, Uncle Liger?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:36.330
I guess we're going to get a first-hand look at my brother's skills, eh?

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.120
Huh?

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.790
Oh, right, yes, you are!

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.250
What's going on here?

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:43.750
The weather!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.840
The weather over the ocean has taken a turn for the worse!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.800
The transfer! You've got to finish the transfer ASAP!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.680
Oh, no! The CR!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.020
Hurry, get that crane over!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.360
It's sinking too fast! Make an emergency dive!

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:07.650
No good! We can't dive in these conditions!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:18.750
Radio-Controlled Robot Competition

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.050
Come on, you can do it!

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:30.010
In your dreams, Mamoru!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:34.510
I wish I knew why boys are so into stupid, juvenile games like this.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.600
RC robots equal power! RC robots are my life!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.430
All boys are passionate about Radio-Controlled robots...

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.390
I think it's just a lot of U.M.L!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.730
Does she mean very UNHIP and MORONIC LAME-ITUDE?

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:46.860
Here goes!

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.230
I don't think so!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.780
Take that!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:55.370
All right!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.950
<i>You did it, Mamoru!</i> All right!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.200
Congratulations...

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.290
I did it! I did it!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.750
I got beat by Mamoru!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.750
How about that!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.430
Welcome to our facilities, Dr. Liger.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.890
It's been a long time, President Taiga!

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.270
Oops, that's Chief Taiga down here, right?

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.150
A shame about the weather...

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.020
The transport operation must have been quite a task!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.940
I'll say! The weather in Japan's just too dodgy!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:33.400
Loaning this old geezer the G-Stone is a recipe for disaster.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.490
Just now he lost the CR container in the ocean...

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.320
The recovery operation was a nightmare!

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:39.620
Hey, you can't pin that on yours truly!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.410
If it wasn't for that sudden storm...

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.290
Come on, Big Brother, you're also trying to pass the buck!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:47.130
Well, what about you? Always carping on insignificant details...

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.250
What did you say?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.460
What the heck?

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.670
Now, now, both of you...

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:55.800
What do you say we all take a look at that CR robot now?

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.100
All right! Open it up now!

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:03.980
Yes, sir!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.440
The container's unlocked!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.700
The CR!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.200
The 13th!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.950
He's gone!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:33.300
Ha! Feast your eyes on my Hyper Sunou SRX!

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.010
What, that's my next opponent?

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:37.890
Are you ready?

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.390
He doesn't have a chance, does he?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.680
We're going home!

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.520
Try to hang in there, buddy!

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.520
He's got a torque of 3,000 and all of his parts are custom-made!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:50.190
No question who's going to end up the winner here!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:56.490
Oh, come on, guys, you don't have to be so scared of my RC robot...

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.240
That's a really huge RC robot...

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.210
Please, forgive me!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:12.090
Hello, everybody! Nice to meet you!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.140
Huh? What's the matter?

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.640
What happened?

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:34.020
Who would've thought it had escaped from the container?

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:39.910
That CR, the 13th, we only initialized its A.I. System 7 weeks ago...

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:43.160
In that case, there shouldn't be any problems with...

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.410
...its basic programs for speech and movement.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.460
The thing is, he still has the mentality of a child.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.880
He'll obey the Three Laws of Robotics, but still...

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.040
I've received word from the Intelligence Unit.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.920
There have been eyewitness reports of a robot...

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.550
...landing on the beach in the S-Block area of G-Island.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:10:59.720
That's him!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:11.900
Even GaoGaiGar doesn't stand a chance against this particular Zonder!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:15.770
And of course, neither does that green-haired child!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.960
Oh! It's getting closer and closer!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.260
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.180
Yay! Let's hand-in-hand!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.970
You, um, what's...

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.770
What's your name?

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.770
Oh! That's right, I haven't introduced myself yet!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:59.490
My name is Mic Sounders 2000!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.240
You can call me Mic!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:04.110
Please, everybody, call me Mic!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.950
Now that's a real Super M.U.B!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.370
What the heck is that?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.700
Super Messed-up Bot, silly!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.500
I'm Mamoru.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.540
My full name's Mamoru Amami!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:18.250
Okay, Mamoru! You're my friend, aren't you?

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:19.630
Friend?

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.590
Zonder! It can't be...

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:27.970
Friend, friend, friend! Mamoru's my friend! Yeah!

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.970
What does he think he's doing?

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.390
Somebody stop him, for Pete's sake!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.810
Not him! It's not this robot...

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:35.400
It's a Zonder!

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.320
The storm system is showing signs of converging on G-Island City!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.070
And as it contracts, both the rainfall and wind speed are...

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.950
...picking up at a fast clip.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.410
How could we have missed it?

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.750
Who would've thought a Zonder was behind this abnormal weather?

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.920
We've received an emergency alert from Mamoru as well.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.300
HyoRyu, EnRyu and Volfogg are handling rescue operations in the...

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.590
...affected areas.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.260
Gai has completed the Fusion process.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.180
Triple-Decked Flying Carrier, separate and launch!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:16.190
It would be dangerous to approach the enemy in this storm!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.190
Not to worry!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.110
We're making our approach in submarine mode.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.110
The storm can't hurt us if we're underwater!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.360
This is Volfogg.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.450
I am now on my way to rescue Special Agent Mamoru and his classmates.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.830
System Change!

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:37.880
Volfogg!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.210
You won't be getting in my way this time, Purple Robot!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:58.020
Volfogg, you've got to hurry!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.400
The roof!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.070
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.530
Hang on, everyone!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.610
We can hold the roof up!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.820
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.240
But if this keeps up, sooner or later the building's gonna collapse!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.200
We're all done for!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.660
Hold on a minute!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.170
Mic!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.130
It's too dangerous to go outside now!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.540
So I'm just gonna have to save you all!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:30.930
What's that?

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.400
Baribarien, on!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.660
Hey, everybody!

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.620
You're all gonna get on my Baribarien and escape, all right?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.540
Mic...

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.950
Who are you, exactly?

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:02.880
It's just as we thought...

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.840
The storm's not nearly as fierce underwater!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.470
Final Fusion, approved!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:15.180
Final Fusion!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:59.430
GaoGaiGar!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.610
The storm's really intense up in the sky!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.520
Is the Zonder inside that tornado?

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.710
Where's the Zonder?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:23.170
What?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.130
What the heck?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.210
Don't copy me!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.130
Don't copy ME!

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.640
W-What's going on here?

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:35.680
At this rate...

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.640
I've spotted a flying object approaching the Zonder.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:42.480
It appears to have the same wavelength pattern as the GS-Ride.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:45.100
That's not possible! How could there be...

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.900
It's the 13th!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.320
Yay!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.110
What?

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.650
What's that black robot?

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.570
What do you mean, the 13th?

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.570
It's the CR that escaped from the container.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.240
What's he thinking, getting so close like that?

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.500
GaoGaiGar!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.750
Is that black robot a friend of yours, Mamoru?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.380
Huh? Yes!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.550
Any friend of yours, Mamoru...

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.470
...is a friend of mine!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.390
So I'm gonna help him!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.890
I, Mic, will help your friend!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.850
You can't do that, Mic!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.520
Even GaoGaiGar can't handle him, so how can you?

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:28.560
No!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:32.360
If someone's in trouble, I can't just stand by and do nothing!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.740
Mic!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:34.780
I'm gonna help!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:35.650
I'm gonna help!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.740
I'm gonna protect my friend!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:38.950
Mic!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.240
Mic!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.080
I'm gonna help GaoGaiGar, okay?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.750
What's that bizarre hunk of metal?

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.420
No way!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.840
Don't tell me that the 13th...

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:59.640
The 13th is about to plunge into the center of the vortex!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.020
What's that?

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.360
Mic!

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:18.360
Oh no!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.240
H-Help me!

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:25.870
What was that, anyway?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.620
Klutz! Thanks for nothing!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.080
The 13th!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.550
EnRyu! HyoRyu! Rescue GaoGaiGar!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.550
They've been immobilized by the storm!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.220
Pliers!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.050
No go, Chief!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:42.680
In case you're wondering, Volfogg is currently missing in action.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:45.180
What can we do?

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.980
Hey there, Chief!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.850
Don't forget about me!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.230
Goldymarg!

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:53.570
That's right! Goldymarg can take any kind of wind pressure!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:54.820
All right!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.490
Goldymarg, launch!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.030
Just leave it to me!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.830
If this keeps up much longer, my armor's gonna go!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.250
Somebody...

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.170
Goldymarg!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:14.920
Hang on, GaoGaiGar!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.710
I owe you one, Goldymarg!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.600
Dividing Driver!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.850
Where are you, Zonder?

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:33.940
Overhead?

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.190
So the Zonder's been manipulating the storm from up there?

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.290
Broken Magnum!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.420
Now's your chance, GaoGaiGar!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.380
All right!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.090
Goldion Hammer...

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:05.680
Activation, approved!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:09.680
Roger!

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.350
Goldion Hammer...

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:15.060
Safety device, relieve!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.740
System Change!

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:39.420
Hammer Connect!

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.340
Goldion Hammer!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:09.580
Hammer Hell!

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.250
Hammer Heaven!

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:26.510
Transform into light!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.190
Unbelievable!

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:45.650
So that hammer can transform even wind into particles of light?

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.030
You won't get away with this, Zonderian!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.500
He's vanished!

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.960
Afterwards, the Intelligence Unit discovered that...

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:05.800
...the Zonder host was a meteorologist who had been stressed out...

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:09.340
...because of criticism regarding the inaccuracy of her forecasts.

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:17.690
Just what kind of use can we put this robot to, I wonder?

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:21.820
NASA pours their resources into building a robot, and this is the result?

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:24.400
Well, well, instead of "casting pearls before swine"...

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:27.360
...we've just cast the G-Stone before my brother Liger!

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:32.580
The protection device installed by yours truly appears to be failsafe!

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:36.250
That immense power, still unknown to even the 13th himself...

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:39.670
...it's still too soon to make it public knowledge, right?

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:48.780
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:51.910
Gathering battle data in the GGG Base Station...

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:55.280
...what is Mic Sounders the 13th's true goal?

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:58.910
Pizza of the Four Machine Kings, Mamoru's classmate, Kaidou...

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.370
And the mysterious Sound Robot.

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:03.330
The fateful hour is drawing near!

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:05.750
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:07.300
"Protection Disabled!"

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
Protection Disabled!

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.680
Boom Robot Mode

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:14.800
This is the Key to Victory!
